<title>GERMANY: Fresenius Medical Q1 net profit up 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Fresenius Medical Q1 net profit up 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March</p>
<p>(in millions of U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   24	up 33 pct</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 0.32    vs n/a dollars</p>
<p>    Group sales				  768     vs 743</p>
<p>    Group cash flow before taxes	   161     up 20 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German dialysis group is Fresenius Medical Care (FMC). Fresenius AG holds a majority stake in the FMC. FMC was created last October when Fresenius merged its dialysis business with National Medical Care, acquired from U.S. group W.R. Grace.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
